3. CERTIFICATE REQUEST THROUGH CMP
======================================================================

The certificate was requested through the Citi Certificate Management Process (CMP).

Before raising the CMP request, confirm:

- Correct environment: DEV/UAT/PROD
- Correct WIP/FQDN
- Certificate Common Name (CN)
- Required Subject Alternative Names (SANs)
- Certificate owner/application owner
- Application/service details
- Certificate validity/renewal requirements

The hostname that clients use must be covered by the certificate CN or SAN.

Example:

If clients access:

nurarec-uat.<Citi-domain>

the certificate must contain the applicable NuraRec UAT hostname in its CN/SAN configuration.


