13. BACKEND / POOL CONFIGURATION
======================================================================

The VIP provides a stable virtual endpoint.

The backend destination can change during infrastructure migration without changing the endpoint known to upstream consumers.

Example:

Old:

WIP → VIP → Old Cluster IP

New:

WIP → SAME VIP → New Cluster IP

Therefore, during migration, verify the backend/pool configuration behind the VIP.


