14. WIP CONFIGURATION
======================================================================

Upstream consumers such as APIGEE use the WIP hostname.

WIP determines/selects the appropriate VIP based on its configured DNS/GSLB behavior.

Conceptually:

                   +--> VIP1
Client → WIP ------|
                   +--> VIP2

WIP does not need to know the individual application pod.

The VIP/backend/ECS configuration handles the next level of routing.

This provides flexibility because the backend infrastructure can change while the externally known WIP remains stable.


