EXECUTOR_CORES
EXECUTOR_MEMORY_IN_GB
DRIVER_MEMORY_IN_GB
DRIVER_CORES
ACTIVE_FLAG

Example:

Workstation + hierarchy_path1 requires:
Executors = 2
Executor Cores = 8
Executor Memory = 20 GB
Driver Memory = 10 GB
Driver Cores = 2

Template API uses consumer + hierarchy path to determine required resources.

AUDIT TABLE

Existing Table:
OM_NURAFLOW_AUDIT_DATA

Purpose:
Tracks request processing and Bulk API submission status.

Recommended statuses:

RECEIVED
WAITING_FOR_RESOURCE
IN_PROGRESS
